 pfx Reroot app;t;p;fns;vars;names;src;f;v;n;m;r;bound
⍝ Give a demo app's objects a new root: refix its code into ⎕THIS with the
⍝ 'F1.' names re-rooted under a tab's SubForm, and its function/variable
⍝ names prefixed so four demos can coexist.
⍝
⍝ pfx is (nameprefix objroot), e.g. 'T2_' 'F1.TC.SF2'. The demo apps stay
⍝ exactly as they are - the gallery is the hack, and it is confined here.
 (t p)←pfx
 bound←{'(?<![A-Za-z0-9_∆⍙])',⍵,'(?![A-Za-z0-9_∆⍙])'}

 fns←(app.⎕NL ¯3)~'Run' 'RunMulti' 'RunDesktop' 'Start'
 vars←app.⎕NL ¯2

 :For v :In vars
     ⍎'⎕THIS.',t,v,'←app.',v
 :EndFor

 :For f :In fns
     src←app.⎕NR f

     :If f≡'Initialise' ⍝ The gallery provides the Form, the tab and the ⎕DQ
         m←(∨/¨(⊂'''Form''')⍷¨src)∨(∨/¨(⊂'CONNECTED')⍷¨src)∨∨/¨(⊂'eDQ')⍷¨src
         src←(~m)/src
     :EndIf

     src←('''F1\.'⎕R('''',p,'.'))src        ⍝ re-root object names
     :For n :In fns,vars                    ⍝ avoid cross-app name collisions
         src←((bound n)⎕R(t,n))src
     :EndFor

     :If ' '≠⊃0⍴r←⎕FX src
         ('Reroot of ',f,' failed at line ',⍕r)⎕SIGNAL 11
     :EndIf
 :EndFor
